    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Dive into the magical world of Dad's Dice, where DnD becomes a reality!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603870/extras/1_606_cut.gif?t=1745888280\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE ADVENTURES BEGINS HERE</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Choose your hero</strong></li></ul><i>Take on the role of a brave dad who ventures without hesitation to aid children kidnapped by a board game. You will have the opportunity to choose one of four heroes: Paladin, Barbarian, Mage or Hunter. Each hero has unique abilities and approaches to the gameplay.</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A wide selection of weapons and special abilities</strong></li></ul><i>The game is filled with various elements of active combat mechanics. Each character class has its arsenal of weapons. Considering the unique characteristics of each item, choose and customize your equipment to your liking. By combining them with your hero's special abilities, you can create an exceptionally effective character, or conversely, choose equipment that will increase the game's complexity for true challenge enthusiasts.</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Roll the dice and test your luck</strong></li></ul><i>Luck also plays a significant role, as the outcome of the dice roll will determine the quality of your spells. Strategic decisions and the ability to adapt to randomness are guaranteed to make this game an unpredictable adventure.</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore the captivating story</strong></li></ul><i>Navigate through numerous levels that will reveal unique challenges and exciting storyline tasks. Collect lost treasures, defeat terrifying monsters, and most importantly, uncover the mystery of the children's mysterious disappearance!</i><br><br><strong>Have fun with Dad's Dice! The choice is yours!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603870/extras/0962d23c0b81f80c0223454c4721aaef.avif?t=1745888280\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Dive into the magical world of Dad's Dice, where DnD becomes a reality!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603870/extras/1_606_cut.gif?t=1745888280\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE ADVENTURES BEGINS HERE</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Choose your hero</strong></li></ul><i>Take on the role of a brave dad who ventures without hesitation to aid children kidnapped by a board game. You will have the opportunity to choose one of four heroes: Paladin, Barbarian, Mage or Hunter. Each hero has unique abilities and approaches to the gameplay.</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A wide selection of weapons and special abilities</strong></li></ul><i>The game is filled with various elements of active combat mechanics. Each character class has its arsenal of weapons. Considering the unique characteristics of each item, choose and customize your equipment to your liking. By combining them with your hero's special abilities, you can create an exceptionally effective character, or conversely, choose equipment that will increase the game's complexity for true challenge enthusiasts.</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Roll the dice and test your luck</strong></li></ul><i>Luck also plays a significant role, as the outcome of the dice roll will determine the quality of your spells. Strategic decisions and the ability to adapt to randomness are guaranteed to make this game an unpredictable adventure.</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore the captivating story</strong></li></ul><i>Navigate through numerous levels that will reveal unique challenges and exciting storyline tasks. Collect lost treasures, defeat terrifying monsters, and most importantly, uncover the mystery of the children's mysterious disappearance!</i><br><br><strong>Have fun with Dad's Dice! The choice is yours!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603870/extras/0962d23c0b81f80c0223454c4721aaef.avif?t=1745888280\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Once, a DnD session went out of control. The kids found themselves in a magical world of tabletop adventures. It's time for Dad to step into the game! Become a hero, roll the dice, and save the children from the clutches of the tabletop monsters. Every roll shapes your destiny!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America",
